ASoC: implement the v19c fixed endpoint and GainStep controls

Port the Golden 0048/0054/0066/0068 stereo ABI. Submit final VOL_CTRL
before its four-frame GainStep OOB delta, under the live graph owner.
Approve only the 30 exact runtime coefficient payloads at reference
commit 3232e1dacdeb580a10a9cb8d4756a4518a7bd83e.
Retain its separate coherent page with the ring until CLOSE and UNMAP;
an unknown MAP, SET_CFG or UNMAP result cannot recycle that DMA backing.
Do not publish these controls on muted fixtures.

